{"id":"af6c2296c347a5b6","group":"58","path":"58/batch07/58-df-analytic-function.md","title":"Analytic Function","display":"df-analytic-function — Analytic Function","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-analytic-function","aliases":["58-df-analytic-function","Analytic Function"],"display":"df-analytic-function — Analytic Function","depends_on":["[[58-df-complex-plane]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-analytic-function"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-analytic-function</span><span>Analytic Function</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-analytic-function — Analytic Function"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1ea2a066d6d8ddc5\" href=\"?note=1ea2a066d6d8ddc5\" title=\"58-df-complex-plane\">58-df-complex-plane</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U \\subseteq \\mathbb{C}\">\\(U \\subseteq \\mathbb{C}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f \\in \\mathbb{C}^{U}\">\\(f \\in \\mathbb{C}^{U}\\)</span> (complex function)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z_0 \\in U\">\\(z_0 \\in U\\)</span> (expansion center)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Analytic}_U\">\\(\\mathrm{Analytic}_U\\)</span> (解析函数谓词)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PowerSeriesExpansion}_S(f,U,z_0)\">\\(\\operatorname{PowerSeriesExpansion}_S(f,U,z_0)\\)</span> (局部幂级数展开谓词, 本文件定义)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}analytic\\text{-}function\\text{-}power\\text{-}series} \\vdash \\operatorname{PowerSeriesExpansion}_S(f,U,z_0) \\;\\leftrightarrow\\; f\\in\\mathbb C^U\\land z_0\\in U \\land \\exists a\\in\\mathbb C^\\omega\\;\\exists r\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\bigl(\\{z\\in\\mathbb C:|z-z_0|&lt;r\\}\\subseteq U \\land \\forall z\\in\\mathbb C\\;(|z-z_0|&lt;r\\to f(z)=\\sum_{n=0}^{\\infty}a(n)(z-z_0)^n)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}analytic\\text{-}function\\text{-}power\\text{-}series} \\vdash \\operatorname{PowerSeriesExpansion}_S(f,U,z_0) \\;\\leftrightarrow\\; f\\in\\mathbb C^U\\land z_0\\in U \\land \\exists a\\in\\mathbb C^\\omega\\;\\exists r\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\bigl(\\{z\\in\\mathbb C:|z-z_0|&lt;r\\}\\subseteq U \\land \\forall z\\in\\mathbb C\\;(|z-z_0|&lt;r\\to f(z)=\\sum_{n=0}^{\\infty}a(n)(z-z_0)^n)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}analytic\\text{-}function} \\vdash \\mathrm{Analytic}_U(f) \\;\\leftrightarrow\\; f\\in\\mathbb C^U \\land \\forall z_0\\in U\\;\\operatorname{PowerSeriesExpansion}_S(f,U,z_0)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}analytic\\text{-}function} \\vdash \\mathrm{Analytic}_U(f) \\;\\leftrightarrow\\; f\\in\\mathbb C^U \\land \\forall z_0\\in U\\;\\operatorname{PowerSeriesExpansion}_S(f,U,z_0)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The disk condition in every local power-series expansion implies that <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span> is open; openness is not left to the Hypothesis prose.</li>\n<li>For one complex variable, equivalence with holomorphy is a theorem; it is not built into this power-series definition.</li>\n<li>Identity theorem: zeros of non-zero analytic function are isolated</li>\n<li>Maximum modulus principle: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|f|\">\\(|f|\\)</span> cannot have local maximum in domain</li>\n<li>Riemann mapping theorem: any simply connected proper open <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\subsetneq \\mathbb{C}\">\\(\\subsetneq \\mathbb{C}\\)</span> is biholomorphic to unit disk</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Ahlfors, Complex Analysis</li>\n<li>Conway, Functions of One Complex Variable</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-complex-plane","status":"resolved","id":"1ea2a066d6d8ddc5","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-complex-plane]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"U \\subseteq \\mathbb{C}","display":false},{"tex":"f \\in \\mathbb{C}^{U}","display":false},{"tex":"z_0 \\in U","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Analytic}_U","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{PowerSeriesExpansion}_S(f,U,z_0)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}analytic\\text{-}function\\text{-}power\\text{-}series} \\vdash \\operatorname{PowerSeriesExpansion}_S(f,U,z_0) \\;\\leftrightarrow\\; f\\in\\mathbb C^U\\land z_0\\in U \\land \\exists a\\in\\mathbb C^\\omega\\;\\exists r\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\;\\bigl(\\{z\\in\\mathbb C:|z-z_0|<r\\}\\subseteq U \\land \\forall z\\in\\mathbb C\\;(|z-z_0|<r\\to f(z)=\\sum_{n=0}^{\\infty}a(n)(z-z_0)^n)\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}analytic\\text{-}function} \\vdash \\mathrm{Analytic}_U(f) \\;\\leftrightarrow\\; f\\in\\mathbb C^U \\land \\forall z_0\\in U\\;\\operatorname{PowerSeriesExpansion}_S(f,U,z_0)","display":true},{"tex":"U","display":false},{"tex":"|f|","display":false},{"tex":"\\subsetneq \\mathbb{C}","display":false}],"bytes":1748,"backlinks":[{"id":"5bbdbb772ea67a47","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Analytic}_\\Omega(f)$ (analytic-function predicate, see [[58-df-analytic-function]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-131","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-analytic-function.md|58-df-analytic-function]]（batch07）"}],"outgoing":["1ea2a066d6d8ddc5"]}